                            Whether you're a student, a working professional, or someone relocating to a new city, StayVista helps you find a place that feels right without wasting time on scattered listings.
                        </p>
                        <p class="about-body">
                            Search across cities, compare options, review amenities, and move from discovery to booking in one place. The platform is built to keep the process practical, transparent, and easy to navigate for both tenants and property owners.
                        </p>
                        <div class="about-points">
                            <div class="about-point">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                                <span>Each listed PG owner goes through a verification process before their property is presented on the platform.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="about-point">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-filter-circle-check"></i>
                                <span>Listings are reviewed regularly so outdated, low-quality, or unreliable options can be filtered out quickly.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="about-point">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i>
                                <span>Support stays available when users need help with search, booking, or general platform guidance.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-5">
                    <div class="about-panel">
                        <div class="about-stat-grid">
                            <div class="about-stat">
                                <strong>City-wise</strong>
                                <span>Explore listings across multiple cities with focused location search.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="about-stat">
                                <strong>Preference-led</strong>
                                <span>Filter by budget, amenities, and stay requirements with less noise.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="about-stat">
                                <strong>Review-ready</strong>
                                <span>Check property images and user feedback before making a decision.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="about-stat">
                                <strong>Booking flow</strong>
                                <span>Move from shortlisting to booking through one connected experience.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="about-note">
                            StayVista is built around clarity: less friction, better discovery, and a calmer way to find temporary accommodation in unfamiliar cities.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="why-us" class="why-section section-block">
